  <para style="h">Sakaraiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sakaraiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sakaraiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sak</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sakaraiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ikood Aditịmme Mbịne <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />Ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaita ke isua ukara ayọhọ iba Dariọs, uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm prọfed Sakaraiya ayịn Berekia, ayịn Iddo:<verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanekke ayat esịd ye mme eteete ndufo. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Ke ntoro dọkkọ mbon awo bo: Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado mi: ‘Itịmme imbịne miin,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ, ‘ndin ami ñyaatịmme ibịne ndufo ñko,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Ndufo ikiiba nte mme eteete ndufo, a-mme prọfed usen edem ekedọkkọke ebo: Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: ‘Iwọññọ ikpọñ mme ndiọi usʌñ ye mme ndiọi adinam ndufo.’ Ado ammọ ikiyemme ikop me adikpañ utọñ innọọ miin, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Mme eteete ndufo eba ke mmọọ idahami? Ñko ye mme prọfed, nte ammọ edu uwem ke nsi-nsi? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Ado nte mme uyio ye mme ewʌhọ mmi, ake ami ñkenọọhọ nditọufọk mmi mme prọfed, ikiyọhọke mme eteete ndufo idem?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">“Akem ammọ emaekappa esịd enyʌñ etañ ete, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan a-anam ye ñnyịn nte adotto ye usʌñ ye edu adinam ñnyịn, kpa naña anye akebiide adinam.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awo ke Atu mme Eto Meetel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Ke ayọhọ usen edịb mme inaañ ke afiọñ duob mme keed, ke afiọñ Sebad, ke isua ubọọñ ayọhọ iba adidem Dariọs, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaawuọ prọfed Sakaraiya ayịn Berekia, ayịn Iddo idem.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />Ami mmaakịt ñkukịd ke akonayio, ndin do ke iso mmi ke ñkekịt awo nte adoro ke anyọñ ndad-ndad enañmbakara. Anye akeda ke atu mme eto meetel ke abedeñ. Mme ndad-ndad, ndana ye mfia enañmbakara emaedudak anye ke edem.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Ami mmaabịp mbo, “Mme nsoo ñkpọ ido ami, abọọñ mmi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">Enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami amaabọọrọ ate,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">“Ami ñyauwọt fiin se ammọ edo.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Akema, awo a-akedaaha ke atu mme eto meetel amaanam anwaña ke, “Ammọ edo mbon se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ abo edʌk ke afịd iso isọñ.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Ndin ammọ emaedọkkọ enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-akedaaha ke atu mme eto meetel ete, “Ñnyịn imisaaña ke afịd isọñ inyʌñ ikịt ke afịd ederimbod aba ke ifuuro ye emem.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Akem enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, adiikpeene die mbemiso afo awọt Yeruselem ye mme abio ke Yuda mbọm mfo, a-afo ayatta esịd ye ammọ ke afịd isua ata mme duob ami?” <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatañ nti ikọ idọñesịd anọ enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Ndin enyere ado a-aketañña ikọ ye ami amaabo, “Tañ ikọ ami anwa-anwa: Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: ‘Ami mmenekke mfịbe akwa ufịb mbaña Yeruselem ye Saiyọn, <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />ñko esịd a-anekke añyat abaña mme idịd e-ebaaha ke ifuuro. Ami ñkeyat esịd etək-etək, ado ammọ emia ammọ ufen ekan naña ñkeyem.’<verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />“Ke ntoro se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami ‘Ami ñyaaben esịd mbọm mmaana mbịne Yeruselem, ñko do ke ediimaana ibọp ufọk mmi. Ndin eyaenyanna udʌk udomoñkpọ ke afịd Yeruselem,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />“Maana tañ anwa-anwa: Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: ‘Uforo ayaamaana afiọrọ ke mme abio mmi, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaamaana adọñ Saiyọn esịd anyʌñ amek Yeruselem.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnʌk Inaañ ye Mme Adomusọ Inaañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Ndin ami ñkedịppe anyen ke anyọñ, se do ke iso mmi mme nnʌk inaañ. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Ami mmaabịp enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami mbo, “Mme nsoo ido ami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">Anye amambọọrọ ate, “Ammọ edo mme nnʌk e-ekesuanna Yuda, Isrel ye Yeruselem.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amañwọt miin mme adomusọ inaañ. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Ami mmaabịp nte, “Nsoo ke ammọ edi adinam?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:21">Anye amambọọrọ ate, “Ammọ edo mme nnʌk e-ekesuanna Yuda mbaak awo ndomokeed adikan adịppe iwuod, ado mme adomusọ ami edi adidịkke ammọ, ñnyʌñ ntoomo nnʌk mme idịd e-ekedịppeke nnʌk ammọ enwana ye isọñ Yuda enyʌñ esuan mbon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet Sek 1:18-21 nte Sek 2:1-4.</char></note> amọ.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Awo a-Akamake Udʌk Udomo Ñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mme ikpañwed Hibru ewet Sek 2:1-13 nte Sek 2:5-17.</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />Akem ami ñkese, se ke iso mmi akedo awodeen a-akekamake udʌk udomoñkpọ ke ubọk amọ. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Ami mmaabịp anye mbo, “Afo akaa uke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">Anye amambọọrọ ate, “Ñka adidomo Yeruselem, adidiọọñọ ukpa ye unyọọñ amọ.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Ke enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami amaakenyọñ, enyere mfen amaadisoobo anye <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />anyʌñ abo anye ate: “Feghe, ke dọkkọ akparawa ado bo, ‘Yeruselem adiido abio i-idiinieghe mme ndibene ato ke uwak ibad mme awo ye mme unam se iba ke esịd. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Ndin ami ñko ke idem mmi ndiido ndibene ikañ ñkanna anye,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, ‘ndin ami ndiido ubọọñ ke esịd amọ.’<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />“Di! Di! Feghe wuọ ke isọñ adoro,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ, “sia ami mmisuan ndufo ke iso afịm anyọñ mbeñ inaañ,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />“Di, Saiyọn! Feghe bọkkọ, afo a-adʌññọ ke Adiaha Babilọn!” <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Sia ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ: “Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Ubọọñ andọñ miin anọ mme idịd se ikibịme ndufo, sia ake awo itotuuk ndufo, atuuk mbon se anye anekke ama. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaasio ubọk mmi ñnyan ammọ nọ mme ifʌn ammọ ebịme ammọ. Ndin afo ayaadiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ake andọñ miin.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />“Ibọñ ñkpọ inyʌñ idaara, Adiaha Saiyọn. Sia ami nsʌk ndi, ami ndiinyʌñ ndʌñ ke atu ndufo,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />“Uwak mme idịd eyaedidiana ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke usen ado nọ ammọ ekappa edo ikọd mmi. Ami ñyaadʌñ ke atu ndufo, ndin afo ayaadiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan andọñ miin inọọ ndufo. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaaben Yuda nte udeeme amọ ke adisana isọñ, ndin ayaamaana amek Yeruselem. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Afịd uduud awo, idop uyio ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> sia anye adakka ada ke idem amọ ato ke adisana itie idʌñ amọ.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Esịn Akwa Aku Nsaana Afọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Ndin anye amañwọt miin Yọsua akwa aku nte naña ada ke iso enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Setan anyʌñ ada ke ubọk nnasia amọ adidot anye uyio. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Setan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Hibru <char style="tl">setan</char> awuọñọ </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">asua.</char></note> ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-asua unọ fiin, Setan! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-akemekke Yeruselem, a-asua unọ fiin! Nte awo ami idooho ifia ikañ e-ekedappake esio ke ikañ?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Idaha ado Yọsua akesịne mbaad afọñ naña anye akedaaha ke iso enyere. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Enyere ado amaadọkkọ mbon se ikida ke iso amọ ate, “Isịññe anye mbaad afọñ amọ ifep.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 3:4">Ndin anye amaadọkkọ Yọsua ate, “Se, ami mmeben idiọọkñkpọ mfo mfep, ñko ami ñyausịn fiin nti afọñ ke idem.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Ndin ami mmaabo, “Bọp afọñiwuod se isana ke iwuod amọ.” Ntoro ke ammọ ekebọp afọñiwuod se isana ke iwuod amọ enyʌñ esịn anye afọñ, ke ini enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesʌkkọ ada do.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Yọsua ewʌhọ ate, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Ami ado se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ: ‘Afo umausaña ke ñkobitem mmi anyʌñ anịm mme mbed mmi, afo ayaakara ufọk mmi anyʌñ ado iwuod ke mme akwere mmi, ñko ami ñyaunọ fiin itie ke atu mbon se ida mi.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />“ ‘Kpañ utọñ, Akwa Aku Yọsua, afo ye mme nsaña mfo e-etieghe ke iso mfo, e-edooho ideen e-edaaha enọ idiọọñọ ñkpọ se idiidi ke ini iso: Ami ñyaaben ayịnufọk mmi, a-adooho Ñkọk, ndi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Se, itiad a-ami nnịmme ke iso Yọsua! Anyen itiaba eba ke itiad keed ado, ñko ami ñyaakap ñkpọ ñwed ke anyọñ amọ,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ, ‘ñko ami ñyaanyʌñ nsio idiọọkñkpọ isọñ ami ke usen keed kpọd.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />“ ‘Ke usen ado ndufo keedekeed eyaekoot mbọhọidʌñ ndufo ebo editie ke idak fain ye eto fik ndufo,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ñkpọ Udodutuenikañ ake Kold ye Eto Ọlif Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Ami akeboiyo, enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami amaatịmme adintọi miin, nte awo etọiyọ ke idab. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Anye amambịp miin ate, “Nsoo ke afo akịt?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Ami mmaabọọrọ nte, “Ami ñkịt udodutuenikañ a-ataa kold ye ntotəño bọwịd ke anyọñ ye utuenikañ itiaba ke anyọñ amọ, ye mme edemeikañ itiaba ammọ. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Ñko eto ọlif iba e-eda ekpere anye, keed ke ubọk nnasia bọwịd, keed ke ubọk ufiin.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Ami mmaabịp enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami mbo, “Abọọñ mmi, mme nsoo ido ami?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Enyere amambọọrọ, “Nte afo udiọọñọke se ammọ edoñño?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Ami mmaabọọrọ, “Iyoo, abọọñ mmi.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Ndin anye amambo miin ate, “Ami ado ikọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> anọọhọ esọk Serubabel: ‘Idooho ke akpọsọñ ukeme me ke adudu, ado ato ke Sịbidịd mmi,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.<verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />“Nsoo ke afo ado, akpọsọñ ekamba abod? Afo ayaakappa ado unaisọñ ke iso Serubabel. Ndin anye ayaasio anaidak itiad nọ ebọñ ñkpo ebo, ‘Abasi adiọñ anye! Abasi adiọñ anye!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Akem ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadi ambịne miin ate: <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />“Ubọk Serubabel akesịn itiad idakisọñ tembịd ami; ubọk amọ adiinyʌñ ibọp anye ikiwuọ utịd. Ke ntoro afo ayaadiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan andọñ miin unọọ fiin.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />“Anie awo asịn usen ntək ñkpọ ke ndek, sia anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> itiaba e-edaaha emọọnọ afịd ederimbod eyaenyʌñ edaara ke ini ammọ ekịtte anaidak itiad e-emekke ke ubọk Serubabel?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Ndin ami mmaabịp enyere ado nte, “Nsoo ido mme eto ọlif iba ami ke nnasia ye ke ufiin itie ñkpọ udodutuenikañ?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Ñko ami mmaamaana mbịp anye mbo, “Nsoo ido mme ñkọk eto ọlif iba ami ke ñkañ adʌk kold iba enwaññake adan kold esio?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Nte afo udiọọñọke se ammọ edo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Ami mmaabo, “Iyoo, abọọñ mmi.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Ndin anye amaabo, “Ammọ edo mbon se eyet adan enịm adinam ñkpọ nnọọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> afịd iso isọñ.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ufọfuurọ Ikpañwed</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Ami mmaamaana nse, se ufọfuurọ ikpañwed ke iso mmi.<verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Enyere ado amambịp abo, “Nsoo ke afo akịt?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Ami mmaabọọrọ anye mbo, “Ami ñkịt ufọfuurọ ikpañwed, anyọọñọ anyan kubid edịb anyʌñ anwaña kubid duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 30 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 15 ke ukpa me mita 9 ke unyọọñ ye mita 4.5 ke ukpa</char></note> ke ukpa.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Akem anye amambo miin ate, “Anye ami ado isuuñọ a-awuọhọ akara afịd isọñ; sia se anye atañ ke ñkañ keed ado ke eyaebịne afịd inọ esio, ndin se anye atañ ke ñkañ uko ado ke eyaebịne afịd awo se inwọñọ ñkpọ ke nsu esio. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan abo, ‘Ami ñyaasio isuuñọ mfep, ndin anye ayaadʌk ufọk awo inọ ye ufọk awo a-anwọñọke ñkpọ ke anyịñ mmi ke nsu. Anye ayaasʌhọ ke esịd ufọk ado anyʌñ abiat anye afịd-afịd, asobo eto ye itiad.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awonwaan ke Esịd Akpasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Ndin enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami amaawuọ adi anyʌñ adimbo, “Dịppe anyen mfo ke anyọñ nyʌñ se se iwuọ ida ami.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Ami mmaabịp mbo, “Nsoo ido ado?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Akpasa ke ado.” Ndin anye amaamaana adian abo, “Anyem ado ukwaññkpọ mme awo ke afịd isọñ.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Akem, emaefʌkkọ ukʌb ñked esio, ndin se awonwaan mi nte atie ke esịd akpasa! <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Anye amaabo ate, “Anye ami ado ibak,” enyere ado amaanyʌñ anək awonwaan ado asịn ke akpasa anyʌñ akʌp anye ke ukʌb ñked.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Ndin ami ñkedịppe anyen ke anyọñ, mmaakịt ibaan iba ke iso mmi, e-ekekamake afịm ke mba ammọ! Ammọ ekenie mba nte ikpañinyañ, ndin ammọ emaebenne akpasa ado ke ufọọd anyọñ ye isọñ.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Ami mmaabịp enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami mbo, “Ammọ eben akpasa ado eka uke?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Anye amambọọrọ, “Eben eka idịd Babilọn nọ ekebọp ufọk enọ anye. Emaebọp ufọk ado ema, eyaenịm akpasa ado ke itie amọ.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ukpadñkpọ Enañmbakara Inaañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Ami mmaamaana ndịppe anyen nse, ndin ke iso mmi ami mmaakịt naña ukpadñkpọ enañmbakara inaañ ekewuọñọ ke ufañ ikpọabod iba, mme ikpọabod brọns. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Akpa ukpadñkpọ akenie ndad-ndad enañmbakara, ayọhọ iba anie mbubịd, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />ayọhọ enañmbakara ita anie mfia, ndin ayọhọ inaañ akedo adọọñọ ñkem, afịd ammọ emaekop adudu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Ami mmaabịp enyere a-aketañña ikọ ye ami mbo, “Abọọñ mmi, mme ñkpọ ami edo nsoo?”<verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Enyere ado amambọọrọ miin ate, “Mbon ami edo mme sịbidịd inaañ e-etooho anyọñ, e-ewuọñọke eto ke iso Abọọñ afịd ederimbod. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Anye mme mbubịd enañmbakara aka ukañ abio adoro, anye ake mfia enañmbakara aka ukañ usobutịn, ndin anye ake mme adọọñọ ñkem enañmbakara aka ukañ usuuk.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Ke ini mme akop adudu enañmbakara ekewuọñọke, ammọ ekeyem edisọsọp ñkaa ñkekanna afịd iso isọñ. Ndin anye amaabo, “Ikaa ke afịd iso isọñ!” Ke ntoro ammọ emaekaa ekekanna ke afịd iso isọñ.<verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Ndin anye amañkoot miin anyʌñ abo ate, “Se, mbon se ika abio adoro e-enọ Sịbidịd mmi nduọkadudu ke isọñ adoro.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enọ Yọsua Anyanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Ami akeboiyo, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadinsịm miin, ate: <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />“Bọi silfa ye kold to mbon e-eketañña esio, Heldai, Tobiya ye Yedaiya, e-eketooho Babilọn edi. Kaa ufọk Yosaiya ayịn Sefanaiya kpa usen ado. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Ben silfa ye kold ado nam anyanya, nyʌñ yat ke iwuod akwa aku, Yọsua ayịn Yosadak. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />Dọkkọ anye bo ke se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: ‘Anye ami ado awo a-anyịñ amọ adooho Ñkọk, anye ñko ayaasakka awuọ ke itie amọ anyʌñ akebọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />Anye ado awo se idiibọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin eyaesịn anye afọñ ubọọñ, ñkọ anye ayaatie anyʌñ akara ke ebekpo amọ. Anye ayaanyʌñ ado aku ke ebekpo amọ. Ñko ndukoppo ayaaba ke ufọọd ammọ iba.’ <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Ediinọ Heldai, Tobiya, Yedaiya ye Hen ayịn Sefanaiya anyanya ubọọñ nte ñkpọ aditoiyo ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Mbon se iba ke anyan usʌñ eyaeto edi edinwam adibọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin afo ayaadiọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan akendọñ miin unọọ fiin. Ami adiitịppe adieke afo anekkeke akpañ utọñ akop uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Unen ye Mbọm, Idooho Utreudia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara Adidem Dariọs, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Sakaraiya ke ayọhọ usen inaañ ke afiọñ usʌkkeed, ke afiọñ Kislef. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Mbon Beteel emaedọñ Saresa ye Rekem-Melek, ediana ye mbon ammọ, nọ ekekpeiye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ubọk <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />ke adibịp mme aku ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ye mme prọfed mbo, “Nte akpena ami mfʌhọ ñnyʌñ ntre ndidia ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition, naña ami ñkenam ke uwak isua ke edem?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan amaadimbịne miin ate: <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Bịp afịd awo ke abio ye mme aku, ‘Idaha a-ndufo eketreke ndidia enyʌñ efʌhọ ke ayọhọ afiọñ ition ye itiaba ke mme isua ata mme duob ke edem, nte akenekke ado ke ntak mmi ke ndufo eketre ndidia enọọ? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Ñko ke ini a-ndufo eketaaha enyʌñ enwọñ, nte ndufo ikisʌkkọ idia usọrọ inọ idem ndufo? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Nte ami idooho mme ikọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> akekwọrọke ato mme prọfed usen edem ke ini Yeruselem ye mme ñkanñkʌk abio ekebaaha ke ifuuro enyʌñ eforo, ndin emaedʌñọ ke Nekef ye ke mme unaisọñ ukañ usobutịn?’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Akem ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatịmme adi abịne Sakaraiya ate: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />“Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan aketañ ado ami: ‘Kịt bo ke e-enọ unenikpe: itua emọ-emọ mbọm ye mfọn. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Ikiifiik ebekpa me ayịnakpa, asenawo me uweene. Ikiinie idiọọk uduak ibaña emọ-emọ.’<verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />“Ado ammọ ikimaaha adikpañ utọñ; ke nsọñiwuod ammọ emaekpa edem enyʌñ esiit utọñ ammọ. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Ammọ emaenam esịd ammọ asọñ nte itiadikañ, inyʌññọ iyem ikop mbed me ikọ <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan akenọọhọ ke Sịbidịd ato mme prọfed usen edem. Ke ntoro <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan amaanekke ayat esịd.<verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />“ ‘Ke ini ami ñkekoodo, ammọ ikikpañña utọñ; ke ntoro ke ini ammọ ekeñkooto, ami ñkibọọrọke,’ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />‘Ami ñkesuan ammọ ke ayobio ndọñ ke atu mme idịd, ke itie a-ammọ ekedooho isenawo. Isọñ a-ammọ ekekpọññọ akedo ataa mbiara tutu awo ndomokeed isañake do iboiyo. Naña ammọ ekeda enam eti isọñ abiara ado ado.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Anwọñọ Adidiọñ Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan amaadinsịm miin.<verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Ami mmefịbe ekamba ufịb mbaña Saiyọn; ke ataa ifiobesịd ke ami mfịbe ufịb mbaña anye.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ ado ami: “Ami ñyaatịmme ñkaa Saiyọn ñnyʌñ ndʌñ ke Yeruselem. Ndin ediikoot Yeruselem Abio Akpanikọ, ñko ediikoot abod <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan Adisana Abod.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Ini keed mfen mme ñkaan ideen ye ñkaan ibaan eyaetie ke mme efaak Yeruselem, ammọ keedekeed ye esañ ke ubọk ato ke ntak isua emana ammọ. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Mme efaak ke abio eyaeyọhọ ye nditọ ideen ye ibaan e-ebreke mbre.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Akeme adido nte ñkpọ ñkpaidem anọ mbon ñyọhọnsʌhọ ibon ami ke ini ado, ado nte adiido ñkpọ ñkpaidem innọ miin?” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Ami ñyaanyaaña ikọd mmi nsio ke ubọk mme abio usakkautịn ye usobutịn. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Ami ñyaakoono ammọ ñnyọñ nọ edidʌñ ke Yeruselem; ammọ eyaedo ikọd mmi, ñko ami ñyaanam akpanikọ ñnyʌñ ñwọt ammọ eti ido nte Abasi ammọ.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Ikop mme ikọ ami, ‘Iyak ubọk ndufo asọñ nọ ekan ebọp tembịd ami ema.’ Ukem ami ke mme prọfed e-ekebaaha ke ini e-ekesịnne itiad idakisọñ ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan eketañ. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Mbemiso ini ado awo ikisikpeeghe mbon awo akʌk utom usen me mme unam se ekedat enam utom. Ñko mme asua ikisiyakka mme awo efrọ ke ifuuro eka ndubeghe ammọ, sia ami mmaanam mme awo ekappa enwana ye mbọhọidʌñ ammọ. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Ado idahami ami ndiinamma ye ñyọhọnsʌhọ ibon ami naña ñkenam ke esed,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />“Ñkpasi ado ayaakọt afọn, eto fain ayaanwịm mfịd amọ, isọñ ayaanọ mbunwịm amọ, mme anyọñ eyaenyʌñ enọ mbara ammọ. Ami ñyaanọ mme ñyọhọnsʌhọ ibon ami afịd mme ñkpọ ami. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Kpa naña ndufo Yuda ye Isrel ekedo isuuñọ ke atu mme idịd, kpa ntoro ke ami ndiinyaaña ndufo, ndin ndufo eyaedo adidiọñ. Ikiifeghe ndịk, ado iyak ubọk ndufo asọñ.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Kpa naña ami ñkebiere adiben nsobo isọk ndufo, ñnyʌññọ ntua mbọm ke idaha a-mme eteete ndufo ekeñyatta miin esịd,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />“ami mmebiere adimaana nnam eti ñkpọ nnọọ Yeruselem ye Yuda. Ikiifeghe ndịk. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Mme ñkpọ a-anaaha nte ndufo enam edo ami: Itañ akpanikọ inọ emọ-emọ, inyʌñ ibiere ikpe ke akpanikọ ye unen ke mme esob ndufo; <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />ikiidioomo idiọọk ibaña emọ-emọ, ikiima adinwọñọ ñkpọ ke nsu. Ami nsasua afịd mme ñkpọ ami,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan amaadinsịm miin.<verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Mme utreudia ayọhọ afiọñ inaañ, ition, itiaba ye duob eyaekappa edo ini idaara ye inemesịd ye usọrọ enọ Yuda. Ke ntoro ndufo ima akpanikọ ye emem.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Uwak mbon awo ye mme andidʌñ ke uwak abio ediisʌk idedi, <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />ñko mme andidʌñ ke abio keed eyaekaa ke abio mfen enyʌñ ekebo ete, ‘Yak ñnyịn ika ini keed ikikpeiye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> inyʌñ iyem iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan. Ami ke idem mmi ñyaakaa.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Ñko uwak awo ye mme akpọsọñ idịd eyaedi ke Yeruselem ediyem iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan enyʌñ ekpeiye anye ubọk.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ ado ami: “Ke mme usen ado awo duob ke afịd mme usem mme idịd eyaesọñ emʌm kpa Yuu keed ke mben afọñ amọ ekama enyʌñ ebo, ‘Yak ñnyịn isaña ye afo, sia ñnyịn imikop ke Abasi mmọdo ye afo.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ubiereikpe Nnọọ Mme Asua Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Ikọ prọfesi Abọọñ a-abañake isọñ Hadrak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">adiinyʌñ ididoro isọñ Damaskọs,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">sia anyen afịd awo ye afịd esiin Isrel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">ese <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char><verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />ye Hamad ñko, a-adiaññake adaña ye anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">ye Tai ye Sidọn, akpesʌkado ammọ enekke enie ifiọk unam ñkpọ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Tai a-abọp akpọsọñ itie anịm anọ idem amọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">anyʌñ akpuut silfa abok abon nte abu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">ye kold nte mbio ke mme efaak.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaabọi anye mme inie amọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">anyʌñ abiat adudu amọ ke akpainyañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">ndin ikañ ayaasobo anye.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Askelọn ayaakịt anye anyʌñ adịkke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Kasa ayaamiañña ke ndutʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">ye Ekrọn ñko, sia idodanyen amọ ayaakpa mfʌhọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Adidem Kasa ayaakpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">ñko awo idiidʌññọ ke Askelọn.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Mme ñwaaha awo ediidʌñ ke Asdọd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:6">ñko ami ñyaanam ntañidem Filistia atre.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Ami ñyaasịññe ammọ iyiib ke inua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">ñnyʌñ mfịppe mbubiam ndidia nsio ke ufañ eded ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Abasi ñnyịn adiinie mbon se iyọhọ isʌhọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">enyʌñ ekappa edo esiin ke Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ekrọn ñko adiiba nte mbon Yebus.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Ado ami ñyaanam nnaaekọñ ke tembịd mmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">nọ ñkpeme anye mbaak mbon anwan se ikpọọrọ isaña.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Mbon ufiik ndomokeed idiibenne abio ikọd mmi aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">sia ami ke idem mmi nsʌk ñkpekpeme anye idahami.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidi Adidem Saiyọn</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Nekke daara, Adiaha Saiyọn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Adiaha Yeruselem, bọñ ñkpo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Se, adidem mfo a-adi ubịne fiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">asaña ye adinen ido ye adikan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">ke nsuukidem anye awat ke dọñki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">adoro ke abaak enañmbakara, ke ataa abaak dọñki.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />Ami ñyaakoono mme sariọd nsio ke Ifrem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">ñnyʌñ ñkoono mme enañmbakara unwana ekọñ nsio ke Yeruselem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">ndin utịgha ekọñ ayaabʌññọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Anye ayaakwọrọ emem anọ mme idịd.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Ukara amọ adiitọọñọ ke akpainyañ keed akewuọ mfen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">anyʌñ atọọñọ ke Inyañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inyañ ado Yufretis</char></note> akewuọ mme utịd ederimbod.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Amaado afo, ke ntak iyiib edioomo mmi ye afo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">ami ñyaasịññe mbon ñkpakọb mfo mfep ke ube unana mmọọñ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Itịmme inyọñọ akpọsọñ itie ndufo, ndufo mbon ñkpakọb idodanyen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">kpa idahami, ami mmesian mbo ke ñyaamaana inọ inie utịb itie iba se ekenenie.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Ami ñyaanuuk Yuda nte nnuuk utịgha mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">ñnyʌñ mben Ifrem nsịn ñyọhọ ke anye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Ami ñyaademme nditọ ideen ndufo, Saiyọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">nọ enwana ye nditọ ideen ndufo, Kriis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">ñnyʌñ nnam ndufo eba nte akañkañ awo uko.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Ayaawuọ Ada</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaawuọ ada ke anyọñ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">idañ amọ ayaasem nte akebkeb.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara ayaafịt adukpoñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">anyʌñ asaña ke ayobio usuuk,<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ayaakwe ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Ammọ eyaesobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">enyʌñ ekama itiad ikañakpọ ekan mme usua.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Ammọ eyaenwọñ enyʌñ ekuun nte mbon eyọhọke ye mmịn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">ammọ eyaeyọhọ nte bọwịd</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">e-ekamake esiime ñkpọ ke mme ñkpitʌñ itie uwa.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ ayaanyaaña ikọd amọ ke usen ado</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">nte akpemeedọñ anyaaña udịmedọñ amọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Ammọ eyaeyamma ke isọñ amọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">nte mme nsọñudua itiad ke anyanya ubọọñ.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Se naña ammọ ediifọọn inyʌñ iyaiya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">Ñkpasi ndidia ayaanam ñkparawa eseghe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">ñko ufa ukọd ayaanam ubọikpa eseghe.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Ayaase Ñkpọ Abaña Yuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Ibeeñe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> edịm ke ini ukwọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado andinọ edịmitiad.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Anye anọ afịd awo ñkeñe ukod edịm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">anyʌñ atọ inwañ anọ afịd awo.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Mme ubobodñkpọ etañ ikọ abiaña-abiaña,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">mme mbiaidiọñ ekịt mme nsu-nsu ñkukịd;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">ammọ enyʌñ etañ mme nsu-nsu ndab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">ammọ enọ mme awo idọñesịd ke ikpu-ikpu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Ke ntoro mme awo ekpọọrọ nte mme edọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">e-ekịtte ukuud sia ammọ inieghe andikpeme.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />“Iyadesịd mmi afiop abaña mme akpemeedọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">ami ñko ñyaamia mme adadusʌñ ufen;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ayaase ñkpọ abaña</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">ufene amọ, kpa ikọd Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">anyʌñ anam ammọ eba nte akịdidem enañmbakara ke iso ekọñ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Itiad idakisọñ adiito Yuda idi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">mboi atayad adiito anye idi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">utịgha iso ekọñ adiito ke anye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">afịd mme adaukara ediito ke anye.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Afịd ammọ ediibit mme anwana anwan ke iso ekọñ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">e-enuakka asua ammọ edọñ ke mbad ke mme efaak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Ammọ eyaenwana sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmọdo ye ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">ammọ eyaenyʌñ enam abuud amʌm mme awad enañmbakara asua.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />“Ami ñyaanọ Yuda adudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">ñnyʌñ ñnyaaña mme esiin Yosef.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Ami ñyaamaana mfọn mfọn ye ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">sia ami mmenie mbọm mbaña ammọ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Ammọ ediiba nte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">akenam ami nsịnne ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">sia ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">ami ñko ñyaayie ammọ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Mbon Ifrem eyaekappa eba nte mbon ekọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">esịd ammọ ayaanyʌñ adat nte enwọñ ukọd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Nditọ ammọ eyaekịt ami enyʌñ edat esịd;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">esịd ammọ ayaadaara ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />Ami ñyaakoot ammọ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">ñnyʌñ ñkoono ammọ mbok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Ke akpanikọ ami ñyaafak ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">ammọ eyaewak naña ekedo ke akpa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Akpesʌkado nte ami nsuanna ammọ ke atu mme idịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">kpayeado ammọ eyaentoiyo miin ke mme anyan idịd.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Ammọ ye mme nditọ ammọ eyaedu uwem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">ammọ eyaenyʌñ etịmme enyọñ edi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Ami ñyaaben ammọ nto Iyib ndi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">ñnyʌñ ntañ ammọ nto ke Asiria ndi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Ami ñyaakoono ammọ ñkaa Kilied ye Lebanọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">ndin ufañ idiikemme afịd ammọ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Ammọ eyaesaña eboiyo akpainyañ mfịna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">awawa akpainyañ ayaadobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">ndin afịd mme udem Nail eyaesaat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Eyaesuuho ntañidem Asiria enịm ke isọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">ndin esañubọọñ Iyib ayaakpọñ anye.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Ami ñyaasọọñọ ammọ idem ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">ndin ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ammọ eyaedʌñ ke ifuuro,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi atañ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Kʌkkọ mme usʌñ mfo, Lebanọn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">nọ ikañ adʌk ata mme eto sida mfo!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Sio ñkpo ayịd, afo yunipa, sia mme sida eduọññọ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">esobo mme ikpọ eto ubọọñ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Isio ñkpo ayịd, ndufo mme eto afriyo ke Basan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">e-etem awọk akai esio!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Ikpañ utọñ ikop ayịd mme akpemeedọñ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">sia e-esobo mme nti awawa mbid ammọ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Ikpañ utọñ ikop uyio ñkuun mme ekpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">sia e-esobo nsek awọk ikọd Yọdan!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Akpemeedọñ Iba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi atañ ado ami: “Bọọk ufene e-enịmme adiwowot. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Awo imiaha mbon se idep ammọ iwot ufen. Mbon se inyam ammọ ete, ‘Ekọọm anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia ami mmemọinyọ.’ Mme andikpeme ammọ inyʌññọ itua ammọ mbọm. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Sia ami ndiinieghe mbọm aba nnọ mbon isọñ ami,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. “Ami ñyaakappa afịd mme awo ami nsịn ke ubọk mme mbọhọidʌñ ammọ ye adidem ammọ. Ammọ eyaesobo isọñ ado, ami ndiinyʌññọ ñnyaaña awo ndomokeed nsio ke ubọk ammọ.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Ndin ami mmaabọọk ufene e-ekenịmme enọ adiwowot, akpan-akpan mme ufene e-ekekuudo. Ndin ami mmaaben esañ iba ñnyʌñ ñkoot keed Mfọn ndin ñkoot anye ako Ndiana, ndin ami mmaabọọk ufene ado. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Ami mmaabịne mme akpemeedọñ ita ado ke ufañ afiọñ keed.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 11:8">Ufene ado emaensua miin, ammọ ñko emaeñkak miin adikama; <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />ami mmaanyʌñ mbo nte, “Ami ndiidooho akpemeedọñ ndufo aba. Yak andibiikpa akpa, andibiisobo asobo. Yak mbon se isʌhọ eta abʌkidem emọ-emọ.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Akem ami mmaaben esañ mmi e-ekoodo Mfọn ñnyʌñ mbuuñ anye, nọ abiat edioomo a-ami ñkenamma ye afịd mme idịd. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Emaebiat edioomo ado ke usen ado, ndin mbon ukuud ke atu mme ufene e-ekenseeghe miin emaediọọñọ ke ami ñkenam uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Ami mmaadọkkọ ammọ nte, “Adieke ndufo ekereke ke anekke afọn ye ndufo, iñkpe miin akʌk mmi; adieke imiifọnnọ, idiañña idem.” Ndin ammọ emaeñkpe miin mbaak silfa edịb mme duob.<verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Top anye nọ abodñkpọ”, nsọñudua ekọmudua a-ammọ ekedotto ke iwuod mmi! Ndin ami mmaaben mbaak silfa edịb mme duob ado ntop ammọ nnọ abodñkpọ ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Ndin ami mmaabuuñ ayọhọ esañ mmi iba e-kekoodo Ndiana, mbiat udʌk imaan ke ufọọd Yuda ye Isrel.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Akem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amambo miin, “Maana ben ñkpọ unam utom ndisịme akpemeedọñ. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Sia ami ñyaasio akpemeedọñ ke isọñ ami i-imiiduakka idọñ anyen mbaña se isop, me adise ñyịn edọñ, me adikọk unan mbon e-enieghe unan, me adinọ andinie nsọñidem ndidia, ado adiita unam edọñ a-anekkeke ayaiya idem, awai mme ñkpad ammọ afep.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />“Adọdiọọk anọ idiọọk akpemeedọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">a-asaanake udịmedọñ ayaak!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Yak akañkañ akpịkke anye ubọk anyʌñ akịm anye anyen ubọk nnasia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">Yak ubọk amọ akpa afịd-afịd,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">yak anye aforo nnan ataa afịd-afịd ke anyen ubọk nnasia amọ!<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s1">Eyaesobo mme Asua Yeruselem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Prọfesi a-atooho Abọọñ a-abañake Isrel.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 12:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 12:1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, a-atatta mme hefịn, a-asịnne itiad idakisọñ ederimbod, a-anyʌññọ abot sịbidịd awo asịn awo ke idem, abo ate: <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Ami ñyaanam Yeruselem aba nte kọọb a-adiinam mme idịd ke ñkanñkʌk eba ke ñkpaidem. Mbon ekọñ eyaekanna Yuda ekʌk kpa ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Ke usen ado, ke ini afịd mme idịd ke ederimbod emaewuọ edibono keed edinwana ye anye, ami ñyaanam Yeruselem ado itiad a-afịd idịd imiidiikanna idịppe. Afịd mbon se inwana adidịppe anye eyaedat unan. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />Ke usen ado ami ñyaatọ afịd mme enañmbakara ñkpeñanyeñ ñnyʌñ ntọ mbon se iwat idaad,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ. “Ami ñyaatat anyen mmi nse Yuda, ado ami ñyaatịp anyen afịd mme enañmbakara mme idịd. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Ndin mme aduuk ke Yuda eyaebo ke esịd ammọ ete, ‘Mbon Yeruselem e-ekop adudu, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan ado Abasi ammọ.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />“Ke usen ado ami ñyaanam mme aduuk ke Yuda eba nte ebohoikañ ke anyọñ abek ifia, nte edemeikañ ke ufọọd abek nsaad mfañ. Ammọ eyaesobo afịd mme idịd ke ñkanñkʌk ke nnasia ye ke ufiin, ado Yeruselem adiisʌk idada itie keed ke itie amọ.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaabemiso anyaaña mme itie idʌñ Yuda, mbaak ukpono ubon ufọk Defid ye mme andidʌñ ke Yeruselem adikpon akan ake Yuda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Ke usen ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaakwe mbon se idʌñ ke Yeruselem, nọ andikpịññe ñkan ke atu ammọ aba nte Defid, ñko ubon Defid adiiba nte Abasi, nte enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abem ammọ iso. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Ke usen ado ami ñyaawuọ nda nsobo afịd mme idịd e-enwanake ekọñ ye Yeruselem.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adifʌhọ Mbaña Awo a-Ammọ Ekekịmme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />“Ndin ami ñyaanwañña sịbidịd mfọn ye ñkpeubọk nnọ ufọk Defid ye mme andidʌñ ke Yeruselem. Ammọ eyaense miin, anye a-ammọ ekekịmme, ndin ammọ eyaefʌhọ ebaña anye nte awo afʌhọ abaña ukweeñe ayịn keed, enyʌñ enekke efʌhọ anye nte awo afʌhọ abaña ñkpa akpa ayịn. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Ke usen ado ntuaña ke Yeruselem ayaakpon nte ntuaña Hadad Rimọn ke unaisọñ Mekido. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Isọñ ayaafʌhọ, ke aduuk ke aduuk, ye ibaan ammọ ke idem ammọ: aduuk ufọk Defid ye ibaan ammọ, aduuk ufọk Natan ye ibaan ammọ, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />aduuk ufọk Lifai ye ibaan ammọ, aduuk ufọk Simei ye ibaan ammọ, <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />ye afịd mme aduuk mfen ye ibaan ammọ.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s1">Adiyet Nsio ke Idiọọkñkpọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />“Ke usen ado eyaekpọkkọ inua mmọọñ enọ ufọk Defid ye mme andidʌñ ke Yeruselem, nọ eyet ammọ esio ke idiọọkñkpọ ye ndek.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />“Ke usen ado, ami ñyaasọọk anyịñ mme ubobodñkpọ nsịññe ke isọñ ami, ndin awo idiitoiyoke ammọ aba,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ. “Ami ñyaasio mme prọfed ye sịbidịd ndedeghe ñkpọ mfep ke isọñ ami. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Ndin adieke awo akeedodo asʌkkọ atañ prọfesi, ete ye eka ammọ, e-ekebonno ammọ, eyaebo ammọ ete, ‘Ana ndufo ekpañña, sia ndufo emesʌhọ nsu ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ Ndin ete mme eka ammọ eyaekịm awo atañña prọfesi ewot.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />“Ke usen ado abuud ayaamʌm afịd mme prọfed ato ñkukịd prọfesi ammọ. Ammọ idiisịneke afọñ a-mme prọfed enamma ke ided ikama ibiaña mme awo. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Ammọ keedekeed eyaebo ete, ‘Ami ndooho prọfed. Ami ndo atọinwañ; isọñ ado usʌñ unwana mmi tọọñọ ke uyịn mmi.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Adieke awo abịppe abo, ‘Mme unan ami ke idem mfo edo nsoo?’ ammọ eyaebọọrọ ete, ‘Edoñño mme unan e-ekennọọhọ miin ke ufọk mme ufan mmi.’<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emaekịm Akpemeedọñ, Edọñ Esuana</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />“Akañkañ, dakkada, ke abaña akpemeedọñ mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ke abaña awo añkpereke miin idem!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan atañ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Kịm akpemeedọñ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ndin mme edọñ eyaesuana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ndin ami ñyaawọññọ ubọk mmi nsịme mme ntək edọñ.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />Ke afịd isọñ ado,” <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">“eyaewot enyʌñ esobo mbakka iba ke itie ita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">ado mbakka keed ke itie ita eyaesʌhọ.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Ami ñyaatañ nsʌhọ mbakka keed ke itie ita ami ndọñ ke ikañ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">ami ñyaadʌkkọ amọ nte silfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">ñnyʌñ ndomo ammọ nte kold.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Ammọ eyaekoot anyịñ mmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">ndin ami ñyaabọọrọ ammọ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">ami ñyaabo, ‘Ammọ edo ikọd mmi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">ammọ eyaenyʌñ ebo, ‘<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi ñnyịn.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-Adi Adidat Ukara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Yeruselem, usen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asʌk adi, ini se ediibịme mme inie mfo enyʌñ ebakka ammọ edeeme kpa ke esịd abio mfo ami.<verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Ami ñyaakoot afịd mme idịd ndi ke Yeruselem, nọ edinwana ye anye; eyaebọ abio ami enie, enyʌñ ekoono mme ñkpọ ke mme ufọk, enyʌñ esappa ibaan. Eyaekoono mbakka iba abio ami ekaa asen idịd, ado awo idiikoonoke mbon se isʌhọ ikpọñ abio ami. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaawuọ akaa akenwana ye mme idịd ado, ukem naña anye asinwana ke usen ekọñ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Ke usen ado ñkpad amọ adiidoro ke anyọñ Abod Ọlif, ke usakkautịn Yeruselem, ndin Abod Ọlif ayaabakka iba tọọñọ ke usakkautịn tutu usobutịn, anịm ekamba abedeñ, keed ke ubaak iba abod ado akaa adoro, ubaak anye ako akaa usuuk. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Afo ayaafeghe afrọ ke abedeñ abod mmi, sia anye ayaatara akewuọ Asel. Afo ayaafeghe nte afo akefegheke abọkkọ unyekisọñ ke mme usen Usaiya adidem Yuda. Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi ayaadi, afịd mme ndisana ikọd amọ ñko eyaesaña ye anye.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Utịn idiisakkake, ndedeñ idiinyʌññọ iba, ndedeñ ekịm idiibaaha, ke usen ado. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Adiido ataa asaña-asaña usen, usen <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> ikpọọñ adiọọñọke, ukpʌhọde idiibaaha ke uweemeayio ye akonayio. Ndubiayio amaadi, unwana ayaaba.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />Ke usen ado mmọọñ uwem ayaawuọ ato Yeruselem, mbakka keed ke itie iba ayaafeghe akaa usakkautịn ke Akpainyañ Inʌñ, mbakka anye ako anyʌñ afeghe akaa usobutịn ke Akpainyañ Mediterenia, ke ndaayio ye ke ukwọedịm.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adiido adidem ke afịd iso isọñ. Ke usen ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> keed ikpọọñ adiiba, ñko anyịñ amọ adiido ukweeñe anyịñ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Afịd isọñ, tọọñọ ke Keba tutu Rimọn, ke usuuk Yeruselem, ediiba nte Araba. Ado Yeruselem adiidoro ke anyọñ tọọñọ ke Inuaatob Benyamin tutu itie Akpa Inuaatob, tutu Inuuk Inuaatob, ñko tọọñọ ke Tọwa Hananel tutu asịm afe utem ukọd adidem, ndin ayaasọọñọ ada ke itie amọ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />Mme awo eyaedʌñọ ke Yeruselem; awo idiisoboke anye aba. Yeruselem ayaaba ke ifuuro.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Anye ami ado udọñọ nsobo <char style="nd">A-Abọọñ</char> adiidat itọ afịd mme idịd e-ekenwanake ye Yeruselem: Ikpọkidem ammọ ayaabʌttọ ke ini ammọ esʌkkọ edada ke ukod ammọ, anyen ammọ ayaayeeme ke ako anyen, ñko edeme ammọ ayaayeeme ammọ ke inua. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Ke usen ado, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaatọ mme awo ekamba ndutịme. Ammọ eyaemʌm emọ-emọ ke ubọk enyʌñ etọọñọ adinwana ke idem ammọ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Yuda ñko ayaanwana ke Yeruselem. Eyaekoono mme inie afịd mme ñkanñkʌk idịd, uwak ibad kold ye silfa ye afọñ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Utọ ukem udọñọ nsobo ado ayaatọ mme enañmbakara ye mme ñwaahadọñki, mme kamel ye mme dọñki, ye afịd mme unam se iba ke mme itie nnaaekọñ ado.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Ado amaakweeñe, afịd mbon se isʌhọ ke afịd mme idịd se ikinwana ye Yeruselem eyaedʌk ekaa ke isua mme isua adikpono Adidem, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, ye adikinam Usọrọ Atayad. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Adieke mme idịd ederimbod etreke adika Yeruselem ñkekpono Adidem, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, edịm idiibaaha inọ ammọ. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Adieke mbon Iyib imiikaaha ikikeene iwana do, ammọ idiinieghe edịm. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanọ ammọ udọñọ nsobo a-anye akenọọhọ mme idịd i-imiimaaha adika ñkenam Usọrọ Atayad. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Ami adiido ufen Iyib ye ufen afịd mme idịd i-imiimaaha adika ñkenam Usọrọ mme Tabanakịd.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Ke usen ado eyaemịñ, “Adisana Ñkpọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>” ke mme ñkanika enañmbakara, ndin mme ako utem ñkpọ ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ediiba nte mme ndisana bọwịd ke iso akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Afịd ako utem ñkpọ ke Yuda ye Yeruselem ediido ndisana inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan, ndin afịd awo se idiidinam uwa eyaedat ubaak ako ado etem ñkpọ. Ñko ke usen ado awo Kenan ndomokeed idiibaaha ke ufọk <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>